<!-- VandiPilot testimonials section — REMOVED FROM THE LIVE PAGE.
     Taken out before launch per Jira ON-19: the quotes, names and star ratings
     below are placeholder content, not real customer reviews.
     To restore: paste this block back into index.html between the "WHY CHOOSE"
     and "CONTACT" sections, re-add <a href="#testimonials">Reviews</a> to the
